.", "fixed_by": "def-forcing-names-and-name-rank", "matters_for": ["lem-forcing-names-and-name-ranks-are-absolute", "def-forcing-name-valuation-and-generic-extension", "def-boolean-valued-name-semantics", "lem-boolean-valued-semantics-is-well-defined"]}, {"convention": "val_G(τ) = {val_G(σ) : ∃p ∈ G (⟨σ,p⟩ ∈ τ)}; M[G] = {val_G(τ) : τ ∈ M a P-name}; G may be empty and no genericity or ZF satisfaction is asserted.", "fixed_by": "def-forcing-name-valuation-and-generic-extension", "matters_for": ["def-check-names-and-the-canonical-generic-name", "thm-check-name-evaluation-and-generic-reconstruction", "thm-generic-extension-transitivity-and-rank-bound", "lem-names-for-pairs-functions-and-ordinals", "lem-lc-boolean-generic-truth"]}, {"convention": "Check names use every condition as coefficient (no largest condition required); ẋ = {⟨ẏ,p⟩ : y ∈ x, p ∈ P} and Ġ = {⟨p̌,p⟩ : p ∈ P}.", "fixed_by": "def-check-names-and-the-canonical-generic-name", "matters_for": ["thm-check-name-evaluation-and-generic-reconstruction", "lem-names-for-pairs-functions-and-ordinals", "ex-boolean-valued-one-bit-name"]}, {"convention": "Boolean equality/membership values use empty join 0 and empty meet 1; existential value is the join over the attained-value subset of B, not over all names; zero coefficients are allowed.", "fixed_by": "def-boolean-valued-name-semantics", "matters_for": ["lem-boolean-valued-semantics-is-well-defined", "lem-lc-boolean-generic-truth", "ex-boolean-valued-one-bit-name"]}, {"convention": "For the Scott ultrapower, [f]_U is the set of functions U-equivalent to f of least membership rank; E is U-large coordinate membership; embeddings are definable class functions with elementarity a formula schema and set restrictions.", "fixed_by": "def-lc-scott-ultrapower-and-class-embedding-convention", "matters_for": ["lem-lc-scott-quotients-are-sets-and-membership-is-setlike", "thm-lc-los-schema-for-universe-ultrapowers", "thm-lc-countable-completeness-and-well-founded-ultrapowers", "l